<RTR> This task will be very much like Exercise 1, though the list of class names will be emitted to a file instead of printed directly on the console screen. Keep in mind that the Generator stores lines of text with no beginning \'91.\'92 in a buffer that can then be directed to a file after the buffer has been filled with all the needed information.\
